      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 4 at.% Cr will be added to the Hf-Mo-Ta-Ti-Zr alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 4 at.% Cr will induce a multicomponent Laves phase in the Hf-Mo-Ta-Ti-Zr BCC alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::chunk::000::abstract::81dff592dd",
        "PMC6197204::chunk::000::abstract::a6951d7e3c"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-induced Laves phase could have a composition such as (Hf,Zr,Ti)Cr2 or (Mo,Ta)Cr2.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will contain approximately 4 vol.% Laves phase.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Laves phase will preferentially form along interdendritic regions where micro-segregation is present.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::chunk::000::abstract::81dff592dd"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Laves phase will form a reticulated or interconnected network.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A reticulated Laves-phase network will deflect and pin cracks, impeding crack extension.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Laves-phase network will force cracks along tortuous phase boundaries and increase fracture surface area rather than allowing propagation through the BCC matrix.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crack deflection by the Laves-phase network will increase fracture strain relative to the Cr-free baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr retained as solute in the BCC matrix will cause local lattice distortion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr-induced lattice distortion will increase Peierls stress and dislocation pinning.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-solution hardening from Cr will increase the alloy's yield strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr has a smaller atomic radius than Hf and Zr.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Incorporation of approximately 4 at.% Cr will contract the BCC lattice and shift its XRD peaks to higher 2θ.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of BCC lattice contraction should be consistent with Vegard's law and proportional to Cr content.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
